# Synthetic large-file fixtures for the hover-preview integration test
# (frontend/components/hoverPreview.integration_test.py). Not committed:
# combined they are ~105MB, and frontend/public/ is copied verbatim into
# frontend/dist/ on every `bun run build` -- including desktop/build.ps1's
# release build -- so committing them would ship 105MB of synthetic test
# data inside the real desktop app. Regenerate locally with
# generate_fixtures.py before running the integration test suite.
under-threshold-45mb.stl
over-threshold-60mb.stl
